  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING: Circular octagonal waterfall abyss rimmed by 4 Waterway Blue Portals \u2014 Sluice-Harpoon two mirror-rafts onto opposite corners and fire ONE blue bolt into a perpetual recirculating 4-portal orbit that holds twin capacitors lit, unlocking the Boss Key island and Spillway Return.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Blue bolts warp indefinitely through Waterway Portals, resetting range and bounces to form a live perpetual circuit powering both orbit capacitors.",
    "decisions": 11,
    "expert_s": 64,
    "reward": "locks_boss_key+cycle_4",
    "why": "Astonishing centerpiece of The Smugglers' Locks awarding the Boss Key and opening Cycle 4 directly back to Sluice Intake r1.",
    "exit": "exit_r10_north",
